    The %SquareDataProvider module provides a data provider API for the Square payments
    and commerce platform.

    To use this module, use \c "%requires SquareDataProvider" in your code.

    All the public symbols in the module are defined in the SquareDataProvider namespace.

    The main classes are:
    - @ref SquareDataProvider::SquareDataProvider "SquareDataProvider":
      the root data provider for Square
    - @ref SquareDataProvider::SquareDataProviderFactory "SquareDataProviderFactory":
      the data provider factory for Square

